* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.db binary

# Raw evidence served to external checkers is hashed into evidence/RAW_INDEX.json, where every digest
# is of the bytes on disk. `-text` disables EOL translation in both directions for those files, so the
# committed bytes and the recorded digests agree; otherwise a CRLF log is rewritten to LF on commit
# and every digest in the index stops being reproducible by a checker.
.hgk/rounds/S4R3-20261013-ci-truthfulness-and-stageb-writeset/evidence/** -text
